{
  "_help": [
    "Signal Desk: which Atlas candidate lists (families) match a signal. Edit storage/atlas-list-map.json (a copy of this file) or use the /lists page; never this default.",
    "Each family has its lists (Permanent, Freelance, or other types such as Contract), matched by id. New Atlas lists are added automatically at most once an hour: to the family with the same name, or as a new family marked \"auto\": true, \"reviewed\": false. A list deleted in Atlas is marked \"status\": \"missing\" and left out of the counts.",
    "Matching order for a signal: 1) roleSubGroups (exact value from column R, or just its code like \"A2\"), 2) keywords found in the job title (whole words), 3) roleGroups (column G). The first rule that matches anything decides; several families can match.",
    "Keywords are lower-case phrases matched as whole words in the normalised title (gender markers like (m/f/x) and seniority words are removed first)."
